   "attribution": null,
   "cause": "When asked about target_appt, a book-only patient has no target_appt, so PatientPolicy.answer emits a prop part with an empty aff list and PatientPolicy.respond still sets act to answer. Voice._prop returns an empty string for a prop with no affirmed or excluded values, resulting in a blank patient line."
  },
  {
   "kind": "fix",
   "files": [
    "clinicbench/policy.py",
    "clinicbench/voice.py"
   ],
   "symbols": [
    "clinicbench.policy.PatientPolicy.answer",
    "clinicbench.policy.PatientPolicy.respond",
    "clinicbench.voice.Voice._prop",
    "clinicbench.voice.Voice.say"
   ],
   "attribution": null,
   "cause": "When asked about target_appt on a booking-only truth (or any proposition with empty affirmed and excluded values), PatientPolicy.answer emits a prop part with aff=[] and PatientPolicy.respond sets act='answer' without falling back. Voice._prop returns '' for empty aff/exc, causing Voice.say to return an empty line."
  },
  null
